<title>GERMANY: Hypobank to keep dividend steady for 96.</title>
<headline>Hypobank to keep dividend steady for 96.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>German commercial bank Bayerische Hypotheken- und Wechsel Bank said on Thursday that it planned to keep its dividend payout steady this year.</p>
<p>Asked if the bank plans to keep its dividend unchanged at 1.45 marks for 1996, chief executive Eberhard Martini said &quot;Yes&quot;.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
